WEBVTT

00:42.792 --> 00:45.962
SOLD OUT ON YOU

00:54.137 --> 00:55.430
GOOD MORNING CREAM VICTIMS

00:55.513 --> 00:58.057
RESTRICTED AREA
EMERGENCY MEDICAL CENTER

01:22.832 --> 01:27.504
Severe side effects have emerged from
users with inflammatory skin conditions

01:27.587 --> 01:29.964
such as atopic dermatitis.

01:30.632 --> 01:33.885
Public anger has been growing
as more child victims

01:33.968 --> 01:38.890
with sensitive and delicate skin
have been affected.

01:48.149 --> 01:49.776
What on earth is going on?

01:50.860 --> 01:52.028
I…

01:53.321 --> 01:54.739
I must have missed something.

01:56.491 --> 01:57.784
Don't be silly.

01:57.867 --> 01:59.744
We ran dozens of clinical trials.

01:59.828 --> 02:01.246
There weren't any issues.

02:01.329 --> 02:03.623
We carried out
strict safety tests as well.

02:03.706 --> 02:05.959
I can't believe this.

02:06.876 --> 02:08.545
I feel like it's all my fault.

02:08.628 --> 02:10.672
No, Hae-seok.

02:10.755 --> 02:12.549
Your recipe was flawless.

02:12.632 --> 02:15.385
If there were any issues with the cream,

02:16.052 --> 02:18.930
it's the CEO's fault
for not managing everything well.

02:19.472 --> 02:20.390
I'm to blame.

02:20.473 --> 02:21.683
Woo-su,

02:22.308 --> 02:23.810
I'm going back to the factory.

02:23.893 --> 02:25.228
I need to check again.

02:25.311 --> 02:26.521
Hae-seok.

02:26.604 --> 02:28.356
You've done your part.

02:29.524 --> 02:30.733
This is my responsibility now.

02:32.068 --> 02:33.111
All of you, just wait.

02:33.194 --> 02:35.113
I'm going to look into this.

02:39.826 --> 02:41.369
Woo-su!

02:41.452 --> 02:43.329
I feel like this is my fault.

02:44.038 --> 02:45.373
So let me go and--

02:45.456 --> 02:46.958
Hae-seok,

02:47.041 --> 02:50.128
we need to focus on the bigger picture.

02:51.796 --> 02:54.424
You have so many things
to do in the future.

02:54.507 --> 02:56.175
Still, I--

02:56.259 --> 02:57.927
I trust you.

03:00.221 --> 03:01.347
You trust me too, right?

03:05.476 --> 03:06.728
We'll fix this.

03:26.998 --> 03:28.249
SLEEP MEDICATION

03:28.333 --> 03:30.877
WOO-SU, WHAT'S GOING ON?
PLEASE ANSWER ME

03:42.680 --> 03:43.932
MU-WON

03:46.100 --> 03:47.101
Mu-won.

03:47.185 --> 03:48.978
Hae-seok, have you been
in touch with Woo-su?

03:49.979 --> 03:51.397
No, I haven't.

03:52.232 --> 03:53.483
He's not answering you either?

03:53.566 --> 03:55.860
He turned off his phone.
Where the hell did he go?

03:56.444 --> 04:00.073
His mother can't reach him either.
Let me know if you get in touch with him.

04:32.355 --> 04:33.398
Woo-su…

04:34.649 --> 04:35.650
Woo-su…

04:48.162 --> 04:49.455
I'm sorry.

04:50.540 --> 04:53.293
Everything was my fault.

05:17.525 --> 05:19.193
Hae-seok, Chang-ho is here.

05:36.461 --> 05:37.628
Come here.

05:37.712 --> 05:39.714
Let's stay with Woo-su together.

05:42.425 --> 05:43.843
Woo-su…

05:46.054 --> 05:47.138
Woo-su…

05:48.890 --> 05:50.641
switched the raw materials.

05:52.101 --> 05:53.978
He even fabricated…

05:55.146 --> 05:57.315
all the clinical trial results…

05:59.484 --> 06:01.319
What are you talking about?

06:01.402 --> 06:02.820
It was all because of money…

06:04.489 --> 06:06.866
That jerk stabbed us in the back…

06:07.492 --> 06:09.786
just because of some money.

06:15.041 --> 06:16.084
Woo-su.

06:16.709 --> 06:17.585
Why did you do that?

06:18.127 --> 06:19.921
-Why?
-Chang-ho, stop.

06:20.004 --> 06:21.130
Why did you do that?

06:21.214 --> 06:22.548
-Don't do this right now!
-Why?

06:22.632 --> 06:24.258
Why the hell did you do that?

06:24.342 --> 06:25.635
Get a grip!

06:25.718 --> 06:26.594
-Why?
-Chang-ho!

06:26.677 --> 06:29.055
Why would you do that?

07:40.084 --> 07:47.049
PERHAPS WE CAN SEE
THE RAINY SEASON TOGETHER

07:56.017 --> 07:57.018
Ye-jin.

08:02.982 --> 08:05.193
I told you it's fine.

08:05.693 --> 08:07.570
All done.

08:07.653 --> 08:09.280
Just eat a little bit.

08:09.363 --> 08:10.490
That's hot.

08:11.449 --> 08:13.201
-Are you okay?
-I'm fine.

08:13.910 --> 08:14.785
Eat up.

08:16.329 --> 08:17.705
Go on. Eat.

08:18.789 --> 08:19.874
Thanks.

08:28.549 --> 08:29.550
Are you doing okay?

08:33.804 --> 08:37.183
You must be tired after your trip.

08:40.728 --> 08:42.396
Am I the kind of person

08:43.356 --> 08:44.941
people get tired of?

08:48.569 --> 08:50.154
Everyone leaves if I show them love.

08:50.905 --> 08:53.282
What are you talking about?

08:55.201 --> 08:56.244
Ye-jin.

08:57.078 --> 08:58.371
I need some rest.

08:59.288 --> 09:00.831
Sorry. I'll clean this up later.

09:20.726 --> 09:22.478
It's suffocating.

09:23.479 --> 09:25.606
I feel suffocated when I'm with you.

09:51.882 --> 09:53.884
-You ruined our lives.
-You said we could trust it.

09:53.968 --> 09:56.178
-You already let go of your guilt.
-How can you do this?

09:56.262 --> 09:58.556
-It hurts!
-I'll hate you for the rest of my life!

10:00.057 --> 10:01.684
I'm sorry, Hae-seok…

10:14.822 --> 10:15.740
SLEEP MEDICATION

10:48.230 --> 10:51.150
-Hey, Mechoori!
-Mechoori!

10:51.233 --> 10:52.360
I bet you haven't heard yet.

10:52.443 --> 10:56.572
Ms. Dam sent us an incredible gift!

10:56.656 --> 10:58.032
Mechoori, look at this.

10:58.699 --> 11:02.411
She sent us a huge TV
and really expensive-looking speakers.

11:02.495 --> 11:06.707
Our community center
practically looks like a theater now!

11:06.791 --> 11:08.084
And…

11:08.167 --> 11:09.752
there's a message here too. Read it.

11:09.835 --> 11:11.128
I FELT SO WARM HERE
THANK YOU

11:14.090 --> 11:15.549
That's great.

11:17.259 --> 11:18.803
"That's great"?

11:19.387 --> 11:21.055
-My gosh.
-It is great.

11:21.138 --> 11:24.850
I haven't seen her recently.
I guess she returned to Seoul.

11:24.934 --> 11:27.019
This must be really expensive.
We're so grateful.

11:28.187 --> 11:30.856
Whenever Ms. Dam does a broadcast,

11:30.940 --> 11:33.359
we're all going to gather
and watch it together.

11:33.442 --> 11:34.527
Of course.

11:34.610 --> 11:36.028
-Not you.
-You stay away.

11:36.112 --> 11:37.530
Just stay home.

11:38.697 --> 11:39.865
Watch wrestling or something.

11:39.949 --> 11:41.742
WORK

12:08.185 --> 12:09.520
DAM YE-JIN IS BACK!

12:12.314 --> 12:13.524
Ms. Dam.

12:13.607 --> 12:15.484
Let's stick together

12:15.568 --> 12:17.069
from now on…

12:17.153 --> 12:18.612
Hey, stop.

12:18.696 --> 12:20.614
Seeing people cry makes me cry too.

12:22.116 --> 12:24.827
Mr. Hwang. Sung-mi.

12:25.578 --> 12:27.121
Thank you so much.

12:29.081 --> 12:30.708
Let's get to work.

12:32.418 --> 12:33.502
Let's do this.

12:48.601 --> 12:51.312
The hotel vacation package
seems to be the best item.

12:51.395 --> 12:52.563
Right?

12:52.646 --> 12:55.566
I struggled so hard not to lose this item.

12:57.526 --> 13:00.154
We've worked hard, so let's head home now.

13:01.155 --> 13:02.448
You guys go ahead.

13:02.531 --> 13:04.617
What? We need to celebrate your first day.

13:04.700 --> 13:06.952
Then I'll find a great place to go.

13:07.036 --> 13:08.537
Okay.

13:09.163 --> 13:12.374
Recommend a nice restaurant nearby
with at least a 4.5-rating

13:12.458 --> 13:14.460
that sells Korean or Western food.

13:14.543 --> 13:15.961
Exclude places with long lines.

13:16.045 --> 13:17.963
And make sure parking is easy.

13:19.048 --> 13:19.924
Cue.

13:20.007 --> 13:21.967
I recommend Garamchae
with traditional Korean food

13:22.051 --> 13:24.970
and the Italian restaurant Fiore Garden.

13:25.721 --> 13:29.642
Both restaurants
are approximately a 10-minute drive away.

13:29.725 --> 13:31.185
We can go to one of these.

13:31.268 --> 13:32.728
Hey, which do you prefer?

13:32.811 --> 13:33.687
Korean? Or Italian?

13:34.313 --> 13:35.773
Let's go next time.

13:35.856 --> 13:36.732
Hey.

13:36.815 --> 13:38.651
Get up while I'm asking nicely.

13:38.734 --> 13:41.987
You saw how everyone's talking about me.

13:42.071 --> 13:43.197
I can't.

13:46.992 --> 13:48.327
Then don't overdo it,

13:48.410 --> 13:50.412
unless you want
striped maple extract again.

13:50.496 --> 13:51.330
All right.

13:51.914 --> 13:54.041
Go on. I'll see you tomorrow.

13:54.124 --> 13:55.042
See you tomorrow.

13:55.668 --> 13:56.710
-We're going, then.
-Okay.

13:56.794 --> 13:58.295
What would you like? Italian? Korean?

13:58.379 --> 13:59.296
Let's go and see.

13:59.380 --> 14:00.881
Join us if you get hungry later.

14:00.965 --> 14:02.341
Okay. Bye.

14:02.424 --> 14:03.300
Bye.

14:22.361 --> 14:25.239
Mr. Cha, what are you doing?

14:30.870 --> 14:31.954
You're here.

14:37.293 --> 14:38.127
Give it to him.

14:43.424 --> 14:45.384
The minutes
from the shareholders' meeting.

14:45.968 --> 14:49.179
The proposal to dismiss you was approved.

14:51.265 --> 14:53.058
No need to say it
in such complicated words.

14:53.893 --> 14:55.394
You mean I'm fired, right?

14:55.936 --> 14:58.355
You should've just kept living
the way you were.

14:59.023 --> 15:00.566
You just had to ruin things.

15:02.735 --> 15:04.570
No, I realized how I should live

15:04.653 --> 15:05.696
thanks to you.

15:08.407 --> 15:10.951
I'll take care of everything here,
so just go home.

15:11.035 --> 15:13.412
You'd better lie low for a while.

15:13.495 --> 15:15.456
We can't brush this off
as immaturity this time.

15:17.666 --> 15:19.585
Thanks for the concern,

15:19.668 --> 15:20.711
but I'll handle it myself.

15:22.630 --> 15:24.006
You're not saying

15:25.132 --> 15:26.967
you want to stay in Korea, are you?

15:31.055 --> 15:32.389
Is it because of that host?

15:33.515 --> 15:34.808
And if I say yes?

15:35.351 --> 15:36.810
Will you steal her away from me too?

15:37.436 --> 15:38.604
What?

15:39.104 --> 15:39.980
Bye, then.

15:47.404 --> 15:48.614
What?

16:00.376 --> 16:02.252
You've changed quite a bit.

16:02.878 --> 16:04.546
You're putting me in a tough spot.

16:05.130 --> 16:08.467
This was the only way to meet you.

16:10.803 --> 16:11.845
Just get to the point.

16:15.182 --> 16:16.725
As you probably guessed,

16:18.435 --> 16:19.812
I'm here because of Ye-jin.

16:22.064 --> 16:23.440
Ye-jin's…

16:25.109 --> 16:26.443
still in a lot of pain.

16:29.655 --> 16:30.489
So?

16:31.949 --> 16:33.367
Couldn't you try…

16:34.535 --> 16:36.829
reaching out to Ye-jin first?

16:40.457 --> 16:42.584
You should've thought
once more before coming here.

16:44.169 --> 16:46.046
Then you would've known I'd refuse.

16:48.924 --> 16:49.967
Just go.

16:50.718 --> 16:52.469
And don't come here ever again.

16:53.679 --> 16:57.016
Do you still have the wrong idea
about what happened five years ago?

16:57.099 --> 17:00.227
The wrong idea? She told me herself
that she was getting revenge.

17:00.310 --> 17:02.730
Are you sure you didn't push her
to say that?

17:05.024 --> 17:07.067
Do you think it was Ye-jin

17:08.235 --> 17:09.528
who said that,

17:10.738 --> 17:12.448
or your heart?

17:14.700 --> 17:16.160
Ye-jin

17:16.744 --> 17:18.370
isn't someone who'd do that.

17:20.039 --> 17:22.207
Think about it carefully, Myeong-hwa.

17:28.464 --> 17:30.132
You really believe such stupid gossip?

17:30.215 --> 17:31.383
What if it isn't just gossip?

17:31.467 --> 17:33.761
You're at the edge of a cliff.

17:33.844 --> 17:35.888
Losing a few roles
isn't the problem right now.

17:35.971 --> 17:38.307
You might be forced out
of the industry altogether.

17:40.434 --> 17:42.978
Whether I fall from that cliff or not,

17:43.604 --> 17:44.605
I'm…

17:46.482 --> 17:47.733
taking responsibility for this.

17:47.816 --> 17:53.572
As of today, I shall retire
from my acting career.

17:55.365 --> 17:58.368
I told you it wasn't just gossip!

17:58.452 --> 18:01.080
Dam Ye-jin really received hush money!

18:04.500 --> 18:05.375
Ms. Song.

18:05.459 --> 18:07.920
Ms. Ji, what brings you here?

18:08.003 --> 18:09.213
I came to join forces.

18:10.005 --> 18:11.215
Join forces?

18:12.424 --> 18:15.677
Dam Ye-jin returned to HIT today.

18:15.761 --> 18:17.679
To be precise, it's her second return.

18:17.763 --> 18:19.014
Honestly,

18:19.098 --> 18:21.892
after what happened with L'Étoile,
something about her feels off.

18:21.975 --> 18:24.978
How is she always causing
scandals like this?

18:25.062 --> 18:26.063
Don't you think?

18:26.647 --> 18:28.232
-Ms. Ji.
-Yes?

18:28.315 --> 18:29.817
I'm just curious,

18:30.442 --> 18:33.320
why do you hate
Dam Ye-jin so much, Ms. Ji?

18:57.052 --> 18:58.387
What about Mr. Hwang?

18:58.470 --> 19:00.889
We just parted
because someone killed the mood.

19:02.808 --> 19:05.435
I just came to kill you with kindness,

19:05.519 --> 19:06.562
so eat up.

19:15.279 --> 19:16.655
You're a workaholic

19:16.738 --> 19:18.824
doing the work that you love so much,

19:18.907 --> 19:21.201
but why do you look so down?

19:21.285 --> 19:24.830
Is your heart elsewhere right now?

19:24.913 --> 19:25.956
What is it?

19:32.254 --> 19:34.298
I broke up with him.

19:37.551 --> 19:38.760
Why?

19:38.844 --> 19:40.512
Why did you get dumped?

19:44.016 --> 19:45.767
Did you really get dumped?

19:45.851 --> 19:47.186
Why did I get that right?

19:47.936 --> 19:48.937
Are you okay?

19:52.107 --> 19:54.234
I want to be fine,

19:56.320 --> 19:59.823
but I feel like there's a hole inside me.

20:00.449 --> 20:02.868
What happened?

20:02.951 --> 20:03.952
He…

20:05.871 --> 20:08.957
was the researcher
who made Good Morning Cream.

20:12.461 --> 20:13.337
Really?

20:15.964 --> 20:17.132
He told me himself.

20:17.758 --> 20:20.427
But why did he tell you now
after all this time?

20:20.510 --> 20:21.637
What about you?

20:21.720 --> 20:22.804
Sung-mi.

20:25.682 --> 20:27.392
I have no idea…

20:29.436 --> 20:31.355
how he truly feels.

20:52.876 --> 20:55.087
DAM YE-JIN

21:09.226 --> 21:10.686
Mom…

21:13.397 --> 21:15.232
I thought

21:16.108 --> 21:19.152
I'd stop thinking about him and be okay

21:19.820 --> 21:22.364
once I went back to work,

21:23.240 --> 21:24.992
but I can't.

21:27.411 --> 21:29.246
He said…

21:30.789 --> 21:33.834
that everything he showed me

21:33.917 --> 21:36.128
and all the moments we spent together

21:37.087 --> 21:39.131
were a lie.

21:40.382 --> 21:41.842
But,

21:43.218 --> 21:46.638
he seemed to be in more pain than me

21:47.556 --> 21:49.433
as he said that.

21:52.227 --> 21:53.520
I don't know.

21:54.313 --> 21:58.233
I have no idea…

21:59.818 --> 22:01.236
But…

22:02.988 --> 22:08.410
I want to hear what's really on his mind.

22:25.177 --> 22:27.304
Hey! Mechoori!

22:27.387 --> 22:28.805
What's wrong? Did you cut yourself?

22:30.348 --> 22:31.892
Oh, no! Hey!

22:31.975 --> 22:33.643
-Let's get that treated.
-I'm fine.

22:33.727 --> 22:37.022
Don't be silly. What's up with you?
This isn't like you at all.

22:37.731 --> 22:38.940
Hey…

22:39.024 --> 22:40.358
I'll go to the hospital.

22:49.868 --> 22:54.206
I'm not sure why you're asking
for sleep medication again…

22:54.998 --> 22:57.292
but you really shouldn't

22:57.375 --> 23:00.504
overuse them like last time,

23:00.587 --> 23:01.630
all right?

23:05.717 --> 23:09.012
Jin-yi, are you closed today?

23:09.096 --> 23:11.473
I'll be back soon after I take Som-yi
to the hospital.

23:11.556 --> 23:13.558
Right, she's getting treated.

23:13.642 --> 23:17.145
So many young kids here
seem unwell these days.

23:17.229 --> 23:20.607
Som-yi's sick,
and Mechoori's looking so down…

23:20.690 --> 23:22.526
Do you know what's going on?

23:22.609 --> 23:24.027
Mechoori

23:24.111 --> 23:26.738
-broke up with Ms. Dam, didn't he?
-He can't have.

23:26.822 --> 23:28.865
-I'm sure he did.
-No way.

23:28.949 --> 23:30.367
I'm sure of it! Hey!

23:30.450 --> 23:32.661
-Bye.
-They must've broken up.

23:32.744 --> 23:34.329
I'm sure of it.

23:38.458 --> 23:40.919
It's going to take ages
going to the hospital by bus.

23:41.837 --> 23:44.631
Can't we just ask Mechoori for a ride?

23:44.714 --> 23:46.007
Don't you dare contact him.

23:46.091 --> 23:47.843
Geez.

23:47.926 --> 23:49.219
Hey! It's Mechoori!

23:51.471 --> 23:53.014
Mechoori!

23:53.765 --> 23:55.267
Hey, get back out here.

23:56.726 --> 23:57.602
I'll give you a ride.

24:01.231 --> 24:04.359
Just until Som-yi's treatment is over.

24:04.442 --> 24:06.862
You shouldn't drive
with your hand like that.

24:06.945 --> 24:08.280
Just stop. Live your own life.

24:08.363 --> 24:09.573
Jin-yi.

24:10.115 --> 24:12.367
It's the least I can do.

24:12.909 --> 24:13.827
Just let me help.

24:15.412 --> 24:17.622
You really have a way
of making me uncomfortable.

24:39.519 --> 24:42.772
The factory manager won't be here today.

24:49.529 --> 24:53.116
Can I ask why you're trying
to get in touch with him?

24:54.951 --> 24:55.952
I have to find out

24:56.036 --> 24:59.247
who made the order to have microbes

24:59.331 --> 25:00.415
added to the essence.

25:01.291 --> 25:02.709
You won't be able to…

25:03.376 --> 25:07.547
find evidence
that this was ordered by the deputy CEO.

25:10.508 --> 25:12.427
You're saying it's meaningless anyway?

25:12.969 --> 25:15.847
Are you telling me to do nothing?

25:15.931 --> 25:16.973
No,

25:20.143 --> 25:21.686
I'm suggesting we do this together.

25:24.314 --> 25:26.650
Why would you join me?

25:26.733 --> 25:29.569
From what I've seen all these years,

25:30.403 --> 25:32.656
even when you wanted something,
you never showed it,

25:33.573 --> 25:35.283
and even what little you had

25:36.368 --> 25:38.995
were things
that Ms. Michelle had thrown away.

25:43.041 --> 25:44.626
Including me.

25:44.709 --> 25:47.462
You're fired. Get out!

25:47.545 --> 25:50.757
Do you not understand? Get out, you jerk!

26:05.480 --> 26:07.899
Why don't you assist me from now on?

26:11.611 --> 26:14.281
If there's anything I can do

26:14.364 --> 26:15.949
to help in this position I owe to you,

26:17.075 --> 26:21.037
I'd like to,
even though it's already late.

26:24.666 --> 26:27.544
Are you sure about this?

26:28.586 --> 26:30.505
I've made up my mind.

26:36.720 --> 26:38.763
I know I should refuse,

26:40.015 --> 26:43.643
but you're the only one
I can trust right now.

26:52.902 --> 26:54.946
Jung-muk!

26:55.030 --> 26:57.365
Jung-muk!

26:57.866 --> 26:59.701
Jung-muk!

27:00.285 --> 27:01.619
Jung-muk!

27:01.703 --> 27:03.079
Jung-muk!

27:03.163 --> 27:05.248
Jung-muk!

27:05.332 --> 27:06.207
I need a diagnosis.

27:07.584 --> 27:08.585
What is it this time?

27:08.668 --> 27:10.837
I bought a ton of her products,
like you told me.

27:10.920 --> 27:12.339
But why is she reacting like this?

27:12.422 --> 27:14.716
She hasn't been replying since yesterday!

27:14.799 --> 27:16.343
You were lacking effort.

27:16.426 --> 27:17.302
Effort?

27:17.385 --> 27:19.304
You should've written a review.

27:21.931 --> 27:23.350
I was so stupid.

27:23.433 --> 27:25.143
I didn't even think of that.

27:25.935 --> 27:26.895
Thanks.

27:26.978 --> 27:28.229
I'll treat you to some meat!

27:30.732 --> 27:31.733
Aren't you dating anyone?

27:36.696 --> 27:38.907
I have no idea what's on his mind.

27:41.868 --> 27:43.661
I bought some!

27:43.745 --> 27:45.121
Order complete!

27:45.205 --> 27:48.458
Organic goat milk powder from Kilimanjaro!

27:48.541 --> 27:50.668
User review!

27:50.752 --> 27:53.046
If I sent a selfie,
he could've at least sent one back.

27:53.129 --> 27:55.632
But he suddenly bought our products
and sent his purchase form.

27:55.715 --> 27:57.467
And now, he even sent a review.

27:59.135 --> 28:01.596
I feel like I've become
a pyramid scheme salesperson.

28:05.600 --> 28:07.102
Is he trying to draw a line?

28:07.936 --> 28:11.731
But men don't spend their money and time
on women they're not interested in.

28:11.815 --> 28:13.942
-Right.
-And he's spending it on you.

28:14.025 --> 28:15.735
And a lot.

28:19.155 --> 28:20.782
Are you saying he's interested or not?

28:20.865 --> 28:23.243
Then what about
when you're talking on the phone?

28:23.326 --> 28:26.746
He gets really chatty on the phone.

28:26.830 --> 28:30.250
He talks about his village
and the mushroom farm and stuff.

28:33.420 --> 28:34.421
What?

28:34.921 --> 28:36.089
Why did you suddenly stop?

28:38.299 --> 28:40.009
Is everything okay over there?

28:40.969 --> 28:42.429
I should be asking that about you.

28:54.023 --> 28:55.066
Yes, Mr. Cha.

28:55.150 --> 28:58.027
I should've taken you there. I'm sorry.

28:58.111 --> 29:00.363
Ms. Michelle suddenly summoned me.

29:00.905 --> 29:01.990
What for?

29:02.073 --> 29:05.160
She wanted coffee
as hot as the core of the sun.

29:05.869 --> 29:08.163
She must think she's Miranda
from The Devil Wears Prada

29:08.246 --> 29:09.372
or something.

29:09.456 --> 29:12.292
Michelle, Miranda…
Those "Mi"s must all be crazy.

29:12.375 --> 29:13.251
Sorry.

29:14.919 --> 29:16.212
Hang in there.

29:16.296 --> 29:19.507
I'm sure you'll have nothing
but good things ahead in your new place.

29:19.591 --> 29:23.011
Oh, and don't forget
to change the door lock code.

29:23.094 --> 29:24.095
Okay.

29:51.206 --> 29:52.040
Mr. Seo?

29:54.042 --> 29:56.127
Ms. Dam. You live here?

29:56.795 --> 29:58.546
Yes, but…

29:58.630 --> 30:01.508
Mr. Cha sent me the address.

30:01.591 --> 30:03.301
I really didn't know.

30:03.384 --> 30:04.469
This is loud, isn't it?

30:05.428 --> 30:07.347
I must have pressed something wrong.

30:07.430 --> 30:08.264
Sorry.

30:10.558 --> 30:12.227
Do you need any help?

30:15.230 --> 30:16.105
Thank you.

30:16.189 --> 30:17.857
It was nothing.

30:17.941 --> 30:18.983
It wasn't nothing.

30:19.067 --> 30:21.402
I almost had to move out
as soon as I arrived.

30:21.486 --> 30:23.947
I've never seen you look
so flustered before.

30:24.614 --> 30:27.242
I didn't expect to see you here.

30:27.325 --> 30:28.868
You must've been even more shocked.

30:28.952 --> 30:30.703
I won't stay here long.

30:30.787 --> 30:33.122
Just for a while,
until things are wrapped up.

30:33.832 --> 30:34.833
I see.

30:34.916 --> 30:37.460
Let me treat you to something in return.

30:37.544 --> 30:38.545
Anything good nearby?

30:43.299 --> 30:46.010
In Korea, we have jjajangmyeon
on the day we move in.

30:46.094 --> 30:48.429
They say black food
chases away misfortune.

30:49.597 --> 30:51.182
You can mix it like this.

30:52.016 --> 30:53.268
I know how to do it.

30:55.562 --> 30:57.230
When did you come back to Seoul?

30:58.106 --> 30:59.649
It's been a while.

30:59.732 --> 31:01.776
I'm preparing for my return broadcast.

31:02.443 --> 31:04.237
Really? I'm glad you decided to return.

31:06.364 --> 31:08.491
How are those things
you said you were wrapping up?

31:10.368 --> 31:11.995
I've only just gotten started.

31:12.829 --> 31:14.372
I've been avoiding it for a long time.

31:15.373 --> 31:17.709
I'm not sure what to do yet,

31:17.792 --> 31:20.378
but I'll just try, like you said before.

31:22.380 --> 31:25.466
Here's your scorching hot coffee.

31:25.550 --> 31:27.886
-It's really hot, right?
-Yes.

31:27.969 --> 31:29.971
Coffee should be hot.

31:32.223 --> 31:33.433
Gosh, that's hot!

31:34.559 --> 31:35.435
Hey!

31:36.352 --> 31:37.604
You wanted it hot…

31:42.609 --> 31:43.860
What about Eric?

31:44.611 --> 31:46.404
He's really going to stay in Korea?

31:49.324 --> 31:51.451
What could he possibly do anyway?

31:52.952 --> 31:55.747
How should I set up your office?

31:55.830 --> 31:57.457
Just the minimum.

31:57.540 --> 31:59.500
I'm just going to resolve
the raw material issue.

32:00.168 --> 32:01.294
Gojeuneok Bio

32:01.377 --> 32:04.380
was pretty firm
about not renewing the contract,

32:04.464 --> 32:06.424
so it won't be easy to convince them.

32:10.136 --> 32:11.846
I'm not wasting my time convincing them.

32:15.224 --> 32:17.477
CEO KANG MU-WON

32:18.394 --> 32:19.979
All our clients

32:20.063 --> 32:23.066
are suddenly canceling their contracts
as if it were coordinated.

32:23.608 --> 32:25.777
Even the ones that said
they'd only use our materials

32:25.860 --> 32:27.570
have suddenly gone silent.

32:28.446 --> 32:32.450
At this rate, we may have to get rid
of all the materials in our storage.

32:32.533 --> 32:33.534
You know that, right?

32:38.164 --> 32:39.165
But you know who I am.

32:40.208 --> 32:42.794
The god of sales, the devil of sales,
the ultimate salesman!

32:43.378 --> 32:44.629
Kang Mu-won.

32:45.546 --> 32:47.757
I booked a meeting with Hong Kong buyers.

32:49.217 --> 32:50.259
But…

32:51.928 --> 32:53.930
they want to meet you as well.

32:54.013 --> 32:56.516
They want to communicate in person.

32:58.101 --> 33:01.270
I know you hate meetings like this,

33:02.605 --> 33:04.524
but come with me, just this once.

33:05.066 --> 33:07.026
-If we miss this opportunity--
-I'll go.

33:08.277 --> 33:09.570
When is it?

33:31.259 --> 33:33.136
PERHAPS WE CAN SEE
THE RAINY SEASON TOGETHER

33:40.476 --> 33:41.686
TRY READING THIS

33:46.024 --> 33:47.483
I don't like scribbling in books.

33:48.109 --> 33:49.318
Scribbling?

33:49.402 --> 33:52.822
You're recording
where you felt your emotions.

33:53.406 --> 33:56.075
I was curious to see
which lines spoke to you.

33:56.159 --> 33:57.452
Try marking them.

34:04.876 --> 34:08.921
TRY READING THIS

34:42.163 --> 34:44.582
Hello, Ms. Dam.

34:45.083 --> 34:48.294
I'm Han Da-sol, the manager
of Selvanta Hotel &amp; Resorts' package.

34:48.377 --> 34:49.462
Nice to meet you, Ms. Han.

34:49.545 --> 34:52.840
Thank you for coming all this way
during your busy schedule.

34:52.924 --> 34:54.759
Of course, I had to come.

34:54.842 --> 34:57.720
Then we'll give you a tour.

34:57.804 --> 34:59.931
-All right.
-This way, please.

35:02.225 --> 35:03.768
GOJEUNEOK BIO

35:17.198 --> 35:19.659
This is Teramondo,
our all-day pub and bar.

35:19.742 --> 35:22.620
We serve a variety of finger foods

35:22.703 --> 35:26.415
to pair with drinks
from all around the world.

35:26.499 --> 35:29.669
A welcome drink
is a part of the package, right?

35:30.920 --> 35:33.464
This lounge is exclusively for our guests.

35:33.548 --> 35:35.091
They can hold business meetings

35:35.174 --> 35:37.718
as well as enjoy
beverages and snacks here.

35:37.802 --> 35:40.555
Can they access it anytime…

36:12.378 --> 36:13.796
Ms. Dam?

36:13.880 --> 36:15.089
-Yes?
-This way.

36:15.173 --> 36:16.299
Oh, right.

36:40.114 --> 36:41.365
Mechoori…

37:39.757 --> 37:42.176
So all of this was because of Ms. Dam.

37:43.844 --> 37:45.554
I saw you two earlier.

37:48.391 --> 37:49.976
I'd like to focus on work right now.

37:50.059 --> 37:52.853
Even if you focus,
just let me talk to you.

37:53.813 --> 37:57.191
I really can't keep watching you
shut yourself away.

37:57.275 --> 37:59.527
Stop avoiding the topic and talk to me.

38:00.528 --> 38:03.531
All right, fine. Take your time.

38:04.240 --> 38:06.409
I told you, what I have most after money

38:06.492 --> 38:08.077
is patience.

38:18.671 --> 38:21.132
I told Ms. Dam everything

38:21.924 --> 38:22.925
and ended things.

38:27.013 --> 38:31.142
When I first found out
you and Ms. Dam were dating,

38:31.225 --> 38:33.185
I was honestly pretty worried.

38:33.269 --> 38:34.312
But…

38:38.107 --> 38:41.694
for the first time in ages,
I saw the Hae-seok that I used to know.

38:45.114 --> 38:46.240
So I couldn't say anything.

38:49.243 --> 38:50.244
Mu-won.

38:52.455 --> 38:54.707
I was being too selfish.

38:56.542 --> 39:00.212
I just hurt her
by starting that relationship.

39:00.755 --> 39:01.672
I'm not so sure.

39:02.631 --> 39:04.216
Could it be those thoughts of yours

39:04.300 --> 39:07.178
made Ms. Dam Ye-jin suffer
even more in the end?

39:09.972 --> 39:12.725
Didn't you let her go
because you didn't want her to feel hurt?

39:13.351 --> 39:15.186
But the look on her face earlier…

39:18.397 --> 39:19.607
You saw it too.

39:49.261 --> 39:50.971
MECHOORI

39:58.479 --> 40:00.481
The person you are calling is unavailable.

40:00.564 --> 40:04.318
Please leave a message after the beep.

40:05.528 --> 40:07.196
Let's talk.

40:09.573 --> 40:13.786
It might be over for you, Mechoori,

40:13.869 --> 40:16.038
but I still have more to say to you.

40:18.874 --> 40:20.835
So let's meet.

40:21.710 --> 40:24.088
Let's meet up and end things properly.

40:35.891 --> 40:38.811
MECHOORI

40:42.857 --> 40:44.275
Where are you?

40:44.358 --> 40:47.027
Ms. Dam.

40:47.778 --> 40:50.239
It's me, Park Kwang-mo.

40:52.032 --> 40:53.200
Mr. Park?

40:53.284 --> 40:57.621
To be honest, this is my number.

40:58.289 --> 41:02.585
You should hear
the full story from Mechoori.

41:04.003 --> 41:08.424
He wouldn't have used my number
for no reason.

41:09.758 --> 41:12.136
-Why…
-Bye, then.

41:24.773 --> 41:26.233
THIS IS MECHOORI'S NUMBER

41:29.612 --> 41:33.115
Ye-jin. This is my number.

41:33.699 --> 41:36.660
You can call me at this number
when you miss me.

41:45.336 --> 41:47.880
RECENT CALLS

41:47.963 --> 41:50.674
01:09 AM, OUTGOING CALL
00:38 AM, OUTGOING CALL

41:55.221 --> 41:58.265
01:11 AM, OUTGOING CALL
CALL RECORDING

41:58.349 --> 41:59.725
-Hello?
-Mom.

42:01.268 --> 42:03.437
Mom, why weren't you picking up?

42:03.979 --> 42:05.147
Are you listening?

42:08.817 --> 42:10.903
You've called the wrong number.

42:13.489 --> 42:14.490
Mom?

42:16.075 --> 42:18.369
-Mom.
-If you call me one more time,

42:18.452 --> 42:21.622
I'm going to call the cops.
This is my last warning.

42:22.748 --> 42:25.209
-Look here.
-I miss you.

42:25.292 --> 42:28.170
I miss you, Mom.

42:29.171 --> 42:31.131
-Hello?
-Mom.

42:31.757 --> 42:33.676
Excuse me. I clearly told you--

42:33.759 --> 42:34.927
It's me, Ye-jin.

42:35.511 --> 42:36.679
What?

42:36.762 --> 42:37.805
Who did you say you were?

42:37.888 --> 42:39.807
Actually, I got hurt today.

42:39.890 --> 42:42.142
Ms. Dam. Are you drunk?

42:42.226 --> 42:43.394
I'm hanging up.

42:45.604 --> 42:46.855
Hello?

42:47.606 --> 42:49.608
Ms. Dam!

42:50.568 --> 42:54.572
Would it be okay
to trust him instead of me

42:55.197 --> 42:57.575
and try this again?

42:58.659 --> 43:01.287
-Mom.
-Ms. Dam, where are you?

43:01.829 --> 43:03.872
Ms. Dam, can you hear me?

43:03.956 --> 43:05.457
Ms. Dam! Where are you right now?

43:06.625 --> 43:09.503
Ms. Dam, can you hear me?

43:09.587 --> 43:10.963
Ms. Dam!

43:13.132 --> 43:16.135
02:26 AM, OUTGOING CALL
CALL RECORDING

43:16.802 --> 43:18.971
He said…

43:19.054 --> 43:21.515
that everything he showed me

43:22.391 --> 43:25.185
and all the moments we spent together

43:25.269 --> 43:27.479
were a lie.

43:28.188 --> 43:30.232
But

43:30.316 --> 43:34.236
he seemed to be in more pain than me

43:35.654 --> 43:37.573
as he said that.

43:38.782 --> 43:40.409
I don't know.

43:42.661 --> 43:45.873
I have no idea…

43:46.665 --> 43:48.125
But…

43:49.752 --> 43:54.548
I want to hear what's really on his mind.

43:59.219 --> 44:00.929
I wasn't lying.

44:02.848 --> 44:04.308
I was happy.

44:07.478 --> 44:10.481
While I was with you,

44:13.275 --> 44:15.819
I felt like I'd become a good person.

44:17.279 --> 44:20.115
And I even thought that perhaps

44:20.199 --> 44:22.117
nothing had happened to me.

44:24.745 --> 44:26.288
But…

44:26.955 --> 44:28.624
I don't deserve this.

44:31.710 --> 44:33.128
I…

44:35.798 --> 44:38.550
killed a close friend
I trusted and admired.

44:40.552 --> 44:42.930
Even when he took full responsibility

44:43.597 --> 44:45.891
and ended his life,

44:47.518 --> 44:48.894
I was hiding

44:49.561 --> 44:52.106
behind his shadow like a coward.

44:53.482 --> 44:54.817
I was scared.

44:59.113 --> 45:02.032
I couldn't bring myself
to face him and our victims.

45:05.202 --> 45:07.121
But after I met you,

45:10.082 --> 45:11.417
I thought

45:13.752 --> 45:15.003
that perhaps…

45:19.508 --> 45:22.052
I could stand back up again

45:24.012 --> 45:25.472
for the first time.

45:27.891 --> 45:30.561
I gained courage while I was with you.

45:31.937 --> 45:33.897
I felt like I could do it

45:34.815 --> 45:36.817
with you by my side.

45:38.694 --> 45:40.779
But I was being selfish.

45:42.114 --> 45:44.867
Even when I knew
how much it would hurt you,

45:46.076 --> 45:47.578
I still liked you.

45:51.790 --> 45:52.875
I'm sorry.

45:56.044 --> 45:58.088
I'm sorry I came to love you

46:00.757 --> 46:02.718
when I couldn't even
take responsibility for it.

46:09.683 --> 46:10.767
And…

46:16.773 --> 46:18.275
I'm really grateful for everything.

46:40.881 --> 46:42.132
I'll give you one each day.

46:42.883 --> 46:45.469
Ms. Dam. Let's meet every day.

46:49.181 --> 46:51.892
Ms. Dam, what are you doing?
Didn't you hear the car?

46:51.975 --> 46:54.311
Ms. Dam, where are you?

46:54.394 --> 46:55.979
Ms. Dam, where are you right now?

46:56.063 --> 46:57.105
Ms. Dam.

46:57.189 --> 46:58.482
Ms. Dam, can you hear me?

46:58.565 --> 47:00.067
Ms. Dam!

47:27.594 --> 47:29.972
DAM YE-JIN

47:41.108 --> 47:42.109
Hello?

47:45.779 --> 47:46.780
Hello?

47:47.573 --> 47:50.325
Ms. Dam, where are you?

47:52.536 --> 47:54.955
Ms. Dam, can you hear me?

47:55.038 --> 47:56.248
-I'm in the park.
-Ms. Dam…

47:57.416 --> 47:58.667
I'll wait for you.

48:44.379 --> 48:47.174
Ms. Dam, are you okay?

48:47.257 --> 48:49.009
Are you hurt or anything?

48:49.092 --> 48:50.218
Let me see…

48:51.386 --> 48:52.971
Look at me.

48:56.141 --> 48:57.643
I knew it.

48:59.061 --> 49:01.104
I knew you'd come running over.

49:10.364 --> 49:11.823
I'll go now.

49:12.866 --> 49:14.660
I heard everything.

49:17.537 --> 49:20.666
I heard how I called you every night,

49:22.376 --> 49:24.711
crying and calling my mom.

49:25.796 --> 49:26.797
And…

49:29.007 --> 49:31.343
I heard what you said as well.

49:36.682 --> 49:38.934
It must have been
so hard for you, all alone.

49:40.477 --> 49:41.937
I know how it feels.

49:42.020 --> 49:44.815
So I can't just leave you alone.

49:49.945 --> 49:51.613
Are you stupid?

49:52.698 --> 49:53.949
Do you still not get it?

49:55.742 --> 49:58.286
All those painful times

49:59.162 --> 50:01.415
you had to go through…

50:03.875 --> 50:05.210
It was all because of me.

50:06.086 --> 50:07.671
If it wasn't for me…

50:08.880 --> 50:10.382
Stop.

50:11.800 --> 50:13.135
Don't say that.

50:16.722 --> 50:18.849
You took all my calls

50:18.932 --> 50:21.518
because you couldn't bear
to leave me alone either.

50:23.770 --> 50:25.605
I feel the same way.

50:39.703 --> 50:41.496
Just stay by my side.

50:43.915 --> 50:46.251
I'll stay by your side too.

51:35.217 --> 51:37.093
I'll check that again.

51:42.057 --> 51:43.892
It seems like you slept well.

51:43.975 --> 51:46.645
How about a spa after our meeting?

51:51.817 --> 51:53.068
What? Who are you…

51:57.531 --> 51:58.448
You found the courage.

51:58.532 --> 52:00.242
Did you eat?

52:01.201 --> 52:02.911
-Yes, I did.
-He did.

52:04.371 --> 52:05.455
Good luck with the meeting!

52:07.874 --> 52:09.751
I'll call you later.

52:13.630 --> 52:14.464
Oh, my.

52:18.093 --> 52:20.428
Just go and talk to her.

52:20.512 --> 52:22.430
Our meeting's about to start.

52:23.390 --> 52:24.391
Sorry.

52:37.320 --> 52:39.447
Should I knock on their door?
I know the room number.

52:40.782 --> 52:41.783
Let's wait a bit more.

52:43.410 --> 52:44.870
It's already been 40 minutes.

52:44.953 --> 52:46.413
This must be something serious.

52:47.080 --> 52:48.582
I'll try calling them one more time.

52:49.207 --> 52:51.501
It didn't seem like
they were just sounding us out.

53:12.314 --> 53:13.899
Ms. Michelle…

53:16.735 --> 53:18.570
We haven't met before.

53:18.653 --> 53:20.363
Nice to meet you. I'm Michelle.

53:24.534 --> 53:26.244
You must be happy to see me.

53:41.801 --> 53:43.720
WHITE FLOWER NOORI MUSHROOM
PURCHASE AGREEMENT

53:44.304 --> 53:46.640
This is the last option for Gojeuneok.

53:46.723 --> 53:50.143
I sent your previous option
back to Hong Kong.

53:51.394 --> 53:55.523
We've made our position clear
to Mr. Eric Seo.

53:57.317 --> 53:58.276
Eric.

53:58.360 --> 54:00.445
He must have forgotten to mention that

54:00.528 --> 54:03.323
since he was packing his stuff in a hurry.

54:03.406 --> 54:06.159
Gojeuneok will not be signing
a contract with L'Étoile again.

54:06.242 --> 54:09.537
But Gojeuneok won't be signing
with any other company either.

54:09.621 --> 54:11.915
Most of them tread carefully around me.

54:13.083 --> 54:15.168
Then send the signed contract
through Mr. Cha.

54:15.251 --> 54:16.419
Don't drag this out.

54:18.046 --> 54:19.589
Gojeuneok

54:20.173 --> 54:21.841
will not sign another contract

54:23.843 --> 54:24.844
with L'Étoile.

54:27.389 --> 54:30.141
All right. Take your time to think.

54:30.225 --> 54:32.852
And there's no need to repeat yourself.

54:32.936 --> 54:34.729
I speak Korean fluently.

54:50.495 --> 54:53.498
All the buyers who kept in touch
are ignoring my calls now.

54:54.541 --> 54:58.253
I did think it was strange
when our clients canceled our contracts.

54:58.336 --> 55:01.047
How far did L'Étoile actually go?

55:01.131 --> 55:03.258
If this drags on any longer,
it could get risky.

55:05.719 --> 55:07.470
Whether it's in Korea or abroad,

55:07.554 --> 55:10.974
check all seminar and expo schedules
where we can meet buyers.

55:12.225 --> 55:14.394
I'm sure we'll find an opportunity.

55:14.477 --> 55:15.520
All right.

55:16.730 --> 55:17.981
GOJEUNEOK BIO

55:19.190 --> 55:21.067
HIT HOMESHOPPING

55:24.279 --> 55:25.655
I can't make it.

55:26.448 --> 55:27.991
I'm sorry.

55:28.825 --> 55:29.826
Is it Mr. Proper?

55:29.909 --> 55:30.994
Yes.

55:32.662 --> 55:33.955
But what's wrong?

55:34.914 --> 55:37.083
You were so happy about dating again.

55:37.709 --> 55:39.419
Did he say he can't make it today?

55:40.003 --> 55:41.755
He said something came up.

55:44.257 --> 55:46.968
Why on earth is he so busy?

55:47.052 --> 55:48.928
Is he just going to work forever?

55:50.680 --> 55:53.183
Are you talking about yourself?

56:17.791 --> 56:20.043
WHITE FLOWER NOORI MUSHROOM
PURCHASE AGREEMENT

56:28.635 --> 56:30.386
Four years ago,

56:30.470 --> 56:33.431
when I suggested starting over…

56:34.974 --> 56:37.102
remember how I promised

56:37.185 --> 56:40.855
I'd let you hold on to your principles
until the end?

56:44.025 --> 56:45.693
It's not over yet.

56:51.366 --> 56:52.367
It is.

56:58.623 --> 56:59.624
No more hesitation!

57:03.545 --> 57:05.338
Lee Hae-seok!

57:06.756 --> 57:07.841
Chang-ho.

57:11.427 --> 57:13.388
You little brat.

57:13.471 --> 57:15.557
How can you not give me a single call?

57:16.391 --> 57:18.351
How have you been?

57:18.434 --> 57:19.352
What…

57:20.103 --> 57:24.149
Right. This is still a formal meeting.
We need an official introduction.

57:24.232 --> 57:26.234
Say hello to the CEO of H.O. Cosmetics,

57:26.317 --> 57:29.446
which is growing fast
across Thailand and Southeast Asia.

57:29.529 --> 57:31.990
Mr. Son Chang-ho.

57:32.073 --> 57:33.658
Hey, you're making me blush.

57:33.741 --> 57:36.536
What happened? How did you…

57:36.619 --> 57:39.080
I contacted Mu-won.

57:39.914 --> 57:43.001
I heard rumors
that L'Étoile's been pressuring you,

57:43.084 --> 57:44.377
and I couldn't just sit still.

57:45.336 --> 57:47.881
H.O. Cosmetics
isn't scared of L'Étoile, you know.

57:48.590 --> 57:50.133
His business reflects his personality.

57:51.384 --> 57:53.511
I think business suits me better.

57:53.595 --> 57:56.264
Don't I look much better
than when I was cooped up in the lab?

57:57.682 --> 57:58.766
You do.

58:11.070 --> 58:12.071
Ms. Dam.

58:15.033 --> 58:16.534
Who were you again?

58:21.915 --> 58:23.708
I'm sorry. Something came up at work.

58:24.626 --> 58:25.627
What was it?

58:28.129 --> 58:29.214
It's been resolved.

58:29.797 --> 58:32.133
I didn't even know.

58:32.217 --> 58:35.136
I was upset that you weren't
messaging me much today.

58:36.012 --> 58:37.764
-I'm sorry.
-Is that it?

58:39.766 --> 58:41.184
I'll treat you to something nice.

58:42.435 --> 58:44.646
You'd better take me to a fancy place.

58:45.730 --> 58:46.564
Shall we go, then?

58:47.148 --> 58:49.400
Let me just go change my shoes.
My feet hurt.

58:57.534 --> 58:58.368
Ms. Dam.

58:59.327 --> 59:00.537
Mr. Seo.

59:04.666 --> 59:06.376
What are you doing here?

59:06.459 --> 59:08.836
Oh, I live here.

59:08.920 --> 59:10.755
I live next door to Ms. Dam.

59:13.591 --> 59:15.426
-Head inside.
-Okay.

59:26.354 --> 59:28.356
Well, Mr. Seo…

59:30.525 --> 59:32.777
You said you'll change your shoes.

59:32.860 --> 59:33.736
Go ahead.

59:35.238 --> 59:36.739
I'll be back in a second.

59:40.660 --> 59:41.869
I won't be long.

59:51.421 --> 59:53.631
THE DAY HE FOUND OUT ERIC
LIVES NEXT DOOR TO YE-JIN

59:53.715 --> 59:55.842
That was a romantic story.

59:55.925 --> 59:58.886
I hope things go well with your neighbor.

59:58.970 --> 01:00:00.555
Let's listen to the song you requested.

01:00:00.638 --> 01:00:01.681
Olive, You Too's

01:00:01.764 --> 01:00:04.642
"I Can't Forget the Pizza
I had with My Neighbor."

01:00:04.726 --> 01:00:07.228
Can't forget… Neighbor…

01:00:07.312 --> 01:00:09.689
I live next door to Ms. Dam.

01:00:13.026 --> 01:00:17.572
I can't eat all this by myself.
What do I do?

01:00:24.537 --> 01:00:26.956
Then you can share it
with your neighbor, no?

01:00:32.170 --> 01:00:34.005
Mr. Seo.

01:00:45.475 --> 01:00:46.643
Neighbor?

01:00:48.603 --> 01:00:50.271
Let's just go to the place next door.

01:00:50.355 --> 01:00:52.148
THE SECOND DAY HE FOUND OUT

01:00:52.231 --> 01:00:53.900
-Next door?
-Yes, their food's great.

01:00:53.983 --> 01:00:55.151
Let's go.

01:01:00.239 --> 01:01:01.282
Oh, no!

01:01:01.366 --> 01:01:03.409
There's a spider!

01:01:09.666 --> 01:01:11.084
You can rely on me.

01:01:16.047 --> 01:01:17.507
Mr. Seo…

01:01:19.217 --> 01:01:20.927
Hey. Come on, baby.

01:01:21.010 --> 01:01:22.804
-No!
-What do you mean?

01:01:22.887 --> 01:01:23.930
Come on. It'll take ages.

01:01:24.013 --> 01:01:25.431
-I'm hungry.
-I'm not going!

01:01:26.599 --> 01:01:27.767
This is the problem with you.

01:01:28.351 --> 01:01:29.977
Why are you so impatient?

01:01:30.061 --> 01:01:31.604
You wanted to eat here.

01:01:31.688 --> 01:01:33.314
You said this place is good!

01:01:33.398 --> 01:01:35.066
Why would you go next door?

01:01:35.149 --> 01:01:36.025
I'm not going!

01:01:38.236 --> 01:01:40.363
Thanks for changing the bulbs for us.

01:01:40.446 --> 01:01:43.658
I used to change the bulbs all the time,
even for my neighbors.

01:01:43.741 --> 01:01:44.826
Who would ask you for help?

01:01:44.909 --> 01:01:46.411
Hey, my neighbors loved me…

01:01:49.789 --> 01:01:52.250
Oh, no! Is this a blackout?

01:01:52.333 --> 01:01:53.626
What do I do?

01:02:01.801 --> 01:02:03.636
Don't you worry.

01:02:03.720 --> 01:02:04.762
Your neighbor is here.

01:02:05.722 --> 01:02:07.223
Mr. Seo…

01:02:11.477 --> 01:02:12.478
Neighbor.

01:02:13.688 --> 01:02:14.689
Neighbor.

01:02:17.817 --> 01:02:19.193
I almost dislocated my shoulder.

01:02:19.277 --> 01:02:20.486
You can't do it.

01:02:20.570 --> 01:02:22.989
How long do I have
to keep doing stuff like this?

01:02:25.616 --> 01:02:27.368
I'm not doing this anymore.

01:02:27.910 --> 01:02:28.786
Handle it yourself.

01:02:28.870 --> 01:02:30.580
What's gotten into him?

01:02:30.663 --> 01:02:31.956
What's with him?

01:02:32.039 --> 01:02:33.416
Oh, right. Mechoori!

01:02:33.499 --> 01:02:34.792
The people next door need--

01:02:35.626 --> 01:02:38.129
Has he lost his mind?
Our neighbors need their light fixed too.

01:02:41.841 --> 01:02:42.717
That's so nice.

01:02:42.800 --> 01:02:43.926
You look beautiful.

01:02:44.635 --> 01:02:47.638
Let's wear white heels.
What about your jewelry?

01:02:47.722 --> 01:02:48.556
Let's see.

01:02:48.639 --> 01:02:50.349
I want to wear this.

01:02:58.566 --> 01:03:00.568
What?

01:03:00.651 --> 01:03:01.527
It's so pretty.

01:03:01.611 --> 01:03:03.654
-Right?
-You'll shine on screen.

01:03:03.738 --> 01:03:05.782
It's my first broadcast after returning.

01:03:05.865 --> 01:03:07.325
I need something special.

01:03:07.408 --> 01:03:08.743
It's gorgeous.

01:03:08.826 --> 01:03:11.579
Everyone, were you looking for me?

01:03:11.662 --> 01:03:13.956
This is exactly the kind of broadcast
you need right now.

01:03:14.040 --> 01:03:17.001
I've returned after a long time
with Selvanta Hotel and Resorts'

01:03:17.084 --> 01:03:20.505
hotel vacation package
that will satisfy your needs.

01:03:20.588 --> 01:03:21.547
This is Dam Ye-jin.

01:03:21.631 --> 01:03:24.050
I'm sure some of you

01:03:24.133 --> 01:03:26.385
feel burdened
by the thought of going abroad,

01:03:26.469 --> 01:03:28.721
but don't want to just stay at home.

01:03:28.805 --> 01:03:31.265
If you want to enjoy a proper vacation
during a short break…

01:03:31.349 --> 01:03:32.892
Mu-won, do you like hotel vacations?

01:03:32.975 --> 01:03:34.352
CEO KANG MU-WON

01:03:34.435 --> 01:03:35.853
Mu-won?

01:03:35.937 --> 01:03:37.396
I love them.

01:03:37.480 --> 01:03:38.523
You scared me.

01:03:41.526 --> 01:03:43.861
-What do you think?
-The two of us?

01:03:51.118 --> 01:03:53.996
CEO LEE HAE-SEOK

01:04:00.419 --> 01:04:03.297
Why would you bulk-buy
hotel vacation packages?

01:04:03.381 --> 01:04:05.800
I'll be doing a broadcast every day.
Will you buy everything?

01:04:05.883 --> 01:04:07.468
I have lots of money.

01:04:16.143 --> 01:04:18.229
Get some sleep, Mechoori.

01:04:18.312 --> 01:04:19.897
No, I'm fine.

01:04:20.481 --> 01:04:21.691
Aren't you going to sleep?

01:04:23.860 --> 01:04:25.903
Well, don't nag me.

01:04:27.321 --> 01:04:30.116
But I can't sleep deeply these days.

01:04:30.950 --> 01:04:32.159
I wake easily from my sleep.

01:04:35.580 --> 01:04:36.581
Since when?

01:04:38.833 --> 01:04:40.084
Since I came back to Seoul.

01:04:41.043 --> 01:04:43.796
Maybe it was the clear water
or the air there,

01:04:43.880 --> 01:04:45.464
but I got much better…

01:04:46.924 --> 01:04:48.718
Maybe it's because I'm alone here.

01:04:51.304 --> 01:04:52.722
Just saying.

01:04:52.805 --> 01:04:55.558
I've been cutting back on coffee,
so I'll get better soon.

01:05:14.869 --> 01:05:16.287
You haven't slept yet?

01:05:16.829 --> 01:05:18.080
Will you come outside?

01:05:21.584 --> 01:05:23.461
What? What's going on?

01:05:30.468 --> 01:05:31.802
Mechoori!

01:05:33.346 --> 01:05:34.555
Let me sleep over.

01:05:35.556 --> 01:05:36.390
What?

01:05:37.350 --> 01:05:38.559
Let's sleep together.

01:05:48.319 --> 01:05:51.906
SOLD OUT ON YOU

01:05:51.989 --> 01:05:54.784
THANKS TO SPECIAL GUEST SEO HYUN-WOO

01:06:26.524 --> 01:06:27.525
Come here.

01:06:27.608 --> 01:06:29.276
Hurry up and sleep.

01:06:29.986 --> 01:06:31.445
Are you a chef?

01:06:31.529 --> 01:06:34.865
The person you cook for
would be really happy.

01:06:34.949 --> 01:06:36.867
Is this what they call
a deep, savory flavor?

01:06:36.951 --> 01:06:38.577
This is really delicious, sir.

01:06:39.537 --> 01:06:40.663
-Ms. Dam!
-Sweetie!

01:06:40.746 --> 01:06:42.748
Is your workplace far from here?

01:06:42.832 --> 01:06:45.167
Can you show us around?

01:06:45.251 --> 01:06:46.711
Let me introduce

01:06:46.794 --> 01:06:49.505
Sollen's steady collection
of men's jackets.

01:06:51.507 --> 01:06:53.050
This is our last rent.

01:06:53.134 --> 01:06:54.635
I'm going to Seoul with Som-yi.

01:06:54.719 --> 01:06:57.263
No! I don't want to live with you.

01:06:57.346 --> 01:06:58.764
What do I do?

01:06:58.848 --> 01:07:00.850
-Som-yi's missing.
-Na Som-yi!

01:07:08.941 --> 01:07:10.943
Subtitle translation by: Juyoung Park
